<div class="modal-header fm-modal-head"><div><h5 class="modal-title">Relationship History</h5><p>Record every meaningful interaction with leads, contacts, and companies.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div>
<div class="modal-body fm-modal-body fm-body">
    <p><strong>Relationship History</strong> provides a chronological record of calls, emails, meetings, notes, and other interactions. Every entry must be connected to at least one CRM record.</p>
    <table class="table table-bordered"><thead><tr><th width="80%">Field</th><th class="text-center">Required</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Type</strong><br><small>The kind of interaction: call, email, meeting, note, or other.</small></td><td class="text-center"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line text-success" title="Required"></i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Date</strong><br><small>The date the interaction took place.</small></td><td class="text-center"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line text-success" title="Required"></i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Subject</strong><br><small>A short, descriptive title for the interaction.</small></td><td class="text-center"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line text-success" title="Required"></i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Related Lead / Contact / Company</strong><br><small>Select at least one record to associate with this entry.</small></td><td class="text-center"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line text-success" title="Required — one or more"></i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Description</strong><br><small>Notes or details about the interaction.</small></td><td class="text-center"><i class="ri-close-line text-danger" title="Optional"></i></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Status</strong><br><small>Choose whether the history entry is active.</small></td><td class="text-center"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line text-success" title="Required"></i></td></tr>
    </tbody></table>
    <div class="fm-grid"><div class="fm-field fm-full"><label>Create an entry</label><div>Click <strong>Add Entry</strong>, choose the interaction type and date, add a subject, relate it to a lead, contact, or company, then click <strong>Create</strong>.</div></div><div class="fm-field fm-full"><label>Find entries</label><div>Use the search box for subjects and descriptions. Use <strong>Advanced Search</strong> to filter by type, related record type, interaction date range, or record status.</div></div></div>
</div>
<div class="modal-footer fm-modal-foot"><span class="fm-foot-note"><i class="ri-information-line"></i> Log interactions promptly so everyone has the latest context.</span><button type="button" class="btn-nx-outline" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button></div>
